      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "EMPHATICALLY YES.\n\nEvery time VRC forces credentials, I have to type a 26 character email address, a 16 character password, and then 2FA as well.\n\nIt's a massive PITA poking at the keyboard in VR, so I usually just take my headset back off and type into the physical keyboard. Except I can't see what I'm inputting if the headset isn't facing the UI when I put it down. ¦O\n\nIt really just needs the UI mirrored to the flat screen too, that would be such a huge change~",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
